Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.08,0:00:06.53,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,The path to the Fairy King has been \Nspoken of only among the royal family
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.53,0:00:08.11,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,of Marinforest for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:11.08,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,It is a light of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.08,0:00:14.04,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,that one loved by the king \Nleft for their descendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:17.50,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,Beyond here is where I'll find Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.53,0:00:21.26,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Elliot, you wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:22.85,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.85,0:00:25.59,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,I am Your Highness's attendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.59,0:00:27.90,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,I cannot allow my master to go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:31.63,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.20,0:00:39.10,Italics,Elliot INT,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed is always \Nso calm and collected,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.10,0:00:43.64,Italics,Elliot INT,0,0,0,,but not when it comes to his beloved \NLady Tiararose, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:45.57,Italics,Elliot INT,0,0,0,,I must be there to support him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.37,0:00:48.93,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,I will save Tiara, whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:51.66,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Right. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.72,0:01:15.47,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an2\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs28\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(604,100)\t(20,4733,\fs23)\move(336,79,336,93,20,4733)\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&H5280F6&)\t(3191,3191,\c&HACF29E&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H19D3F7&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HFC8A3D&)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}Is {\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&HEF65A0&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H7B72F5&)\t(3399,3399,\c&HEFF400&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HB36BF7&)}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:33.01,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(560,1)\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\pos(320,123)\c&HB36BF7&\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\b1}Hold{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}Me... {\b1\c&HFC8A3D&}Tighter{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.18,0:02:43.53,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,This is a rather impressive path.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:46.08,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,The type I imagine \Nthe Forest Fairy King would like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.08,0:02:50.11,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Yes. Keith, the Fairy King, \Nis most likely up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.50,0:02:55.11,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I just have no way of knowing how far.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:57.59,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,It is a magic path, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.28,0:03:02.28,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,I've been trying to search \Nand inspect the surrounding area,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.28,0:03:03.85,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,but it isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:06.29,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:10.17,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,If you can't do it, \Nit would be difficult for anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.45,0:03:14.30,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,If something happens to Tiara \Nwhile we're stuck here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.01,0:03:19.14,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.87,0:03:26.10,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Thorns? What in the world is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:28.75,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It's a trap set by the Forest Fairy King.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.75,0:03:31.48,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,A trap? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.98,0:03:35.11,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,He must really not want us \Nto go any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.57,0:03:39.53,Flashback,Keith FB,0,0,0,,Tiara...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.53,0:03:42.08,Flashback,Keith FB,0,0,0,,I'll be taking her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.42,0:03:56.27,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed, please \Ndon't press too far forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.27,0:04:00.39,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,We don't know what traps might \Nlie ahead. It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:03.70,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,No matter how dangerous \Nit may be, I'm still going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:06.33,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I have to get to Tiara \Nas quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.65,0:04:15.36,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.11,0:04:28.22,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Move aside, sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.83,0:04:41.65,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Let's hurry, Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:43.03,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.46,0:04:46.72,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,I can't tell who is \Nwhose attendant anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.99,0:04:48.98,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,Tiara...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.39,0:04:56.73,Default,Forest Fairy1,0,0,0,,Oh, Tiara's awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.73,0:04:57.97,Default,Forest Fairy2,0,0,0,,Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.97,0:04:59.77,Default,Forest Fairy3,0,0,0,,Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.77,0:05:01.74,Default,Forest Fairy4,0,0,0,,Have some fruit with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:03.33,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,They're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.74,0:05:07.20,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But... why are there fairies here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.53,0:05:09.84,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.27,0:05:13.82,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Keith brought me here against my will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.50,0:05:16.41,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I need to get back quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.21,0:05:18.96,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,K-Keith?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.52,0:05:24.06,Default,Forest Fairy1,0,0,0,,The king isn't here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.06,0:05:25.95,Default,Forest Fairy2,0,0,0,,Play with us, Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.95,0:05:30.67,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What? I don't mind playing, but I want \Nto go back to the castle for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.67,0:05:32.19,Default,Forest Fairy3,0,0,0,,Eat this! Eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:33.99,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,All right, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.62,0:05:38.02,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.02,0:05:40.37,Default,Forest Fairies,0,0,0,,Eat this, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.37,0:05:41.68,Default,Forest Fairy5,0,0,0,,It's a strawberry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.68,0:05:43.41,Default,Forest Fairy1,0,0,0,,We have apples, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.41,0:05:46.44,Italics,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Well, I can't turn down \Nthe fairies' goodwill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:48.56,Default,Forest Fairy3,0,0,0,,Eat lots!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.54,0:05:51.17,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,This is too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:54.75,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I can't eat this much!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.07,0:05:58.09,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you. I'm full now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.09,0:05:59.53,Default,Forest Fairy4,0,0,0,,Oh, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.53,0:06:01.07,Default,Forest Fairy5,0,0,0,,Was it yummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.07,0:06:05.71,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes, very. All the blessings \Nof the forest are so delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.86,0:06:10.19,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It's as if the forest is enveloping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.19,0:06:13.53,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It feels so comfortable \Nand calming, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:17.30,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Fairies, I'd like \Nto go home to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:19.10,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,How can I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.10,0:06:20.82,Default,Forest Fairy1,0,0,0,,You're leaving already?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.82,0:06:22.76,Default,Forest Fairy2,0,0,0,,We want to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.76,0:06:26.27,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'll play with you next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:28.65,Default,Forest Fairy3,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:30.04,Default,Forest Fairy4,0,0,0,,This way, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.45,0:06:38.21,Default,Forest Fairy5,0,0,0,,Come this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:39.56,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,That way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.47,0:06:47.79,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What? A kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:52.59,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,But why...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.59,0:06:56.06,Default,Forest Fairy1,0,0,0,,The king had it prepared just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.06,0:06:58.40,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What? Keith did?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.40,0:07:03.22,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It did seem like he enjoyed \Nthe sweets I made, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.58,0:07:06.93,Default,Forest Fairy2,0,0,0,,These are sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.93,0:07:09.27,Default,Forest Fairy3,0,0,0,,And these are salty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.27,0:07:11.79,Default,Forest Fairy4,0,0,0,,And these are {\i1}very{\i0} spicy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:15.71,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,So they're flowers and nuts \Nto use as seasonings?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.71,0:07:17.28,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,May I taste them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.28,0:07:18.29,Default,Forest Fairies,0,0,0,,You may!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.75,0:07:24.02,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,That's sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.09,0:07:27.30,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The pink flowers are sugar,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:29.30,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,and the blue ones are salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.30,0:07:31.51,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The red flowers are spicy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.51,0:07:35.24,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,and I bet I could use \Nthe yellow ones as pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:39.02,Default,Forest Fairy5,0,0,0,,These make a tasty soup \Nwhen you stew them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.02,0:07:41.44,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,The fairies of the forest are amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:43.35,Default,Forest Fairy1,0,0,0,,Tiara, make some sweets!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.35,0:07:44.68,Default,Forest Fairies,0,0,0,,Make sweets!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.68,0:07:46.70,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What? Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.70,0:07:51.20,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,B-But seeing Prince Aqua \Nis my first priority right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.70,0:07:54.20,Default,Forest Fairy1,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:56.14,Default,Forest Fairy2,0,0,0,,We'll help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.14,0:07:59.92,Default,Forest Fairy3,0,0,0,,And when the sweets are done, \Nwe'll show you the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.42,0:08:05.46,Default,Forest Fairies,0,0,0,,We'll help! We'll help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.68,0:08:11.23,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I guess you're not going to let me \Ngo home until I make some sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:15.77,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,This feels so strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.77,0:08:17.92,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The ingredients aren't what I usually use,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.92,0:08:21.90,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,so I'm kind of looking forward to \Nseeing how they taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.31,0:08:25.10,Default,Forest Fairy4,0,0,0,,We'll put in the flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.10,0:08:26.49,Default,Forest Fairy5,0,0,0,,Flutter, flutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.23,0:08:32.03,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Huh? That's the sweet flower \NI tasted before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:37.10,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It's not as sweet as sugar, \Nand it looks nice, so I guess it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.21,0:08:41.56,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I wish I had these seasonings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.56,0:08:42.98,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.98,0:08:47.71,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,How would it look if I told the guy \Nwho kidnapped me that I wanted seasonings?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.89,0:08:53.96,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'll finish up with some flowers \Nfor garnish, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.33,0:09:03.60,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,The cupcakes are done!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.77,0:09:07.43,Default,Forest Fairy1,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.98,0:09:10.72,Default,Forest Fairy2,0,0,0,,Cupcakes are yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.72,0:09:13.99,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm so glad. Now, be sure \Nto take me to the exit, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:15.55,Default,Forest Fairy3,0,0,0,,You can count on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.55,0:09:17.96,Default,Forest Fairy4,0,0,0,,We'll take you there, Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.53,0:09:19.89,Default,Forest Fairy5,0,0,0,,Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.89,0:09:21.82,Default,Forest Fairy1,0,0,0,,Open it! Open it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.79,0:09:24.89,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'm finally at the exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.58,0:09:31.31,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:33.60,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,not an exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.60,0:09:36.14,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Just what is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:41.48,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Is that a throne?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:44.47,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It seems so lonely somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:50.72,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I need to get back now. \NPrince Aqua might be worried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.13,0:09:54.58,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,He saw me with Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.58,0:09:58.54,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,If I saw Keith with \Nanother girl, I'd be jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:01.18,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I don't want any more \Nmisunderstandings between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.56,0:10:04.43,Default,Forest Fairy4,0,0,0,,Who's Prince Aqua?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.43,0:10:06.63,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,He's my fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.63,0:10:08.89,Default,Forest Fairy5,0,0,0,,Is that the person you love?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.89,0:10:11.80,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes. I love him very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.91,0:10:19.94,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua has made \Nhis love for me very clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.06,0:10:24.79,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.31,0:10:28.29,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The compelling force of an \Notome game is a terrifying thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:33.71,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I really don't understand humans at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.71,0:10:34.67,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.21,0:10:36.95,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,K-Keith?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.49,0:10:39.41,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.02,0:10:47.11,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Please stop this! Why must you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:49.59,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Do you want to go back to the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:51.30,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Of course I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:52.30,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.30,0:10:56.84,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I don't want to trouble \NPrince Aqua any further!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.84,0:10:59.35,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I don't want to be a burden to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.72,0:11:02.81,Italics,Keith INT,0,0,0,,Just the fact that she's loved \Nby the forest fairies means
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.81,0:11:07.05,Italics,Keith INT,0,0,0,,not only is she not a burden, but she's \Ncontributing plenty to the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:11.36,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Humans really are such a hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.82,0:11:14.44,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,You need only wait, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.49,0:11:16.55,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.67,0:11:24.75,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.17,0:11:28.63,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.90,0:11:36.47,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs24\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(516,1)\pos(328,51)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&}Is {\c&HB36BF7&}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.45,0:11:44.98,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Let go of Tiara, Fairy King Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:48.56,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,And if I refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.86,0:11:55.03,Default,Aqua,0,0,0,,I will take her back by force \Nif I must, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.93,0:12:01.27,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,A human king and a fairy king \Nmustn't fight over me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:04.77,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.77,0:12:06.93,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Even if you are a fairy king,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:09.37,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I will not allow you \Nto lay hands on Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.37,0:12:13.88,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Hah. Don't you already have all \Nthe women you could ever want?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.88,0:12:16.64,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,The only one I need is Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.47,0:12:21.26,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh. \NTiara has felt uneasy all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.44,0:12:25.01,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,And it was you \Nwho made her feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.44,0:12:29.76,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,No matter who you are... \Nfairy king or not...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.13,0:12:32.78,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I won't let you have Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.40,0:12:35.95,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Keith, please stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.95,0:12:39.93,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Tiara, you shouldn't interfere \Nin a battle between men.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.19,0:12:42.41,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.25,0:12:54.42,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Do you really believe a mere human \Ncan defeat a fairy king?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:58.37,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Even if the odds are against me, \NI cannot afford to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.04,0:13:06.64,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,For a human, you aren't half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.95,0:13:10.39,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,A king must be strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.73,0:13:14.74,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,He needs to hold up his kingdom \Nand protect what's important!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.93,0:13:20.90,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Hmm... Indeed, the kings of the past \Nexcelled in the martial arts, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.01,0:13:30.51,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You stopped my blade with a fan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.50,0:13:39.74,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.47,0:13:41.60,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.74,0:13:52.48,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Wh-Where is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.80,0:13:58.11,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,A cliff?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.12,0:14:01.90,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I see now. We're on top of a mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:04.97,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Yes, the tallest one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.97,0:14:08.81,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I can look down upon everything \Nin this kingdom from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.81,0:14:10.16,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,The kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.49,0:14:14.00,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It sounds as if he's \Nprotecting the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.40,0:14:17.14,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,If you fall, you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.54,0:14:19.57,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,So as long as I don't fall, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.35,0:14:23.38,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.25,0:14:32.11,Italics,Keith INT,0,0,0,,Ah, he can make his magic \Nsurround his sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.99,0:14:34.37,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.48,0:14:41.11,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,At this distance, Tiara shouldn't \Nbe close enough to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:50.95,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:15:02.91,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I don't want Prince Aqua \Nor Keith to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.91,0:15:07.24,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm being selfish, \Nbut I want them both to stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:16.33,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Was that shallow?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.29,0:15:23.41,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.70,0:15:36.21,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua! Keith! Please stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.21,0:15:37.21,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:49.01,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.39,0:15:52.57,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.73,0:16:05.28,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,P-Prince Aqua?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.23,0:16:07.36,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,At last...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:10.24,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,At last, I get to hold you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.84,0:16:12.35,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.54,0:16:16.68,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I know I've made you feel uneasy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.18,0:16:19.38,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,all because I lack strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:20.56,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:23.52,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,No... No, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.34,0:16:29.71,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You've made time for me every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.12,0:16:33.65,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm the one who's in the wrong \Nfor being jealous of Lady Icilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.64,0:16:37.57,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You were jealous? Over me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.18,0:16:46.80,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,A-At a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.66,0:16:49.66,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.99,0:16:54.43,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I know it's imprudent of me, but knowing \Nyou felt that way makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:56.57,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.16,0:17:05.90,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara, hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.90,0:17:07.21,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I-I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.93,0:17:11.86,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Oddly, even in the situation \Nwe're in, I don't feel scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.57,0:17:15.83,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I know that Prince Aqua will keep me safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.20,0:17:20.06,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Fairies of the sky, \Nhear my voice and answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.40,0:17:25.65,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Really, he's always so reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:31.48,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Facing off against a fairy king?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.84,0:17:33.61,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,He's left me with no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.69,0:17:45.63,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I owe you a debt, sky fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.63,0:17:48.86,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Sky, become my wings and catch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.10,0:18:01.62,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,How beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.22,0:18:07.71,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua is trying his hardest \Nto protect this beautiful kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.71,0:18:11.98,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,How wonderful. I want to \Nsupport this kingdom with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.27,0:18:14.37,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.37,0:18:19.72,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing. I feel as if I was \Nworrying over something truly trivial.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:21.37,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,But from now on...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.53,0:18:26.38,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I think I'll be able to \Nwork even more by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.73,0:18:36.67,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Now, please don't ever do \Nanything like this again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.67,0:18:38.18,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.47,0:18:40.64,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(397,1)\shad0\fs24.5\pos(323,295)\b1\fnTimes New Roman\3c&H2E4074&\c&HF0F3F7&}One Hour of Lecturing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.79,0:18:40.64,Default - Top,Keith/Aquasteed,0,0,0,,We're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.93,0:18:42.96,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.96,0:18:45.68,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,We'll spend even more time \Ntogether from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.68,0:18:49.15,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll just have to \Nvisit you more frequently.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.07,0:18:52.40,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I feel like that's not quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.53,0:18:57.47,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara is busy spending her time with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.47,0:19:00.64,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I fear she will have \Nlittle time for official business
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.64,0:19:03.41,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,such as audiences with fairy kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.41,0:19:06.37,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,You've gotten a lot more cheeky \Nin such a short time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.80,0:19:09.10,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I'll just come visit her at night, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.10,0:19:12.42,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Then I will simply share \Na bedroom with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.42,0:19:14.13,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Stop it right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:22.14,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,A human king and fairy king working \Ntogether to help Marinforest grow...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.14,0:19:25.19,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,That would be the ideal thing \Nfor this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.19,0:19:28.24,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Isn't there any way \Nto make them get along?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.83,0:19:30.62,Default,Forest Fairy1,0,0,0,,Tiara, have some sweets!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.62,0:19:32.32,Default,Forest Fairy2,0,0,0,,Let's eat together!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.32,0:19:36.81,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.16,0:19:40.36,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.81,0:19:45.35,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,If they eat some sweets, \Nmaybe they'll feel happy and get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.35,0:19:47.82,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But there's only one cupcake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.94,0:19:49.82,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.14,0:19:53.13,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.13,0:19:57.46,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I made this with the fairies earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.46,0:19:59.70,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I love Prince Aqua,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.70,0:20:06.31,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,but I want to work with the forest fairies \Nto make this kingdom more prosperous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.31,0:20:08.20,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,So I split this in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.96,0:20:13.60,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,If the two kings work together, \Nthis kingdom can prosper even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.05,0:20:17.77,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,That won't be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.77,0:20:18.86,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:19.36,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:24.46,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I told you not to touch my fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.07,0:20:33.96,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You'll support this kingdom \Nby my side, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.96,0:20:39.18,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Here. Eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.64,0:20:43.64,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.04,0:20:47.61,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Eat this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.38,0:20:54.69,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Flowers gifted to me by both of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.69,0:20:56.79,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It makes them taste doubly sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:01.67,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.67,0:21:02.74,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.74,0:21:05.28,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,They were fighting just moments ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.06,0:21:11.75,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Maybe these two have more \Nin common than I thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.09,0:21:19.05,Default,Forest Fairy1,0,0,0,,It's like Tiara is the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:25.56,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It's true! I feel as if I have \Ntwo kings at my service now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.86,0:21:31.52,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,You really are great, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.01,0:21:37.38,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Th-This is not a laughing matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.86,0:21:44.51,Italics,Keith INT,0,0,0,,I've begun to look forward to \Nthis kingdom's future a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.97,0:23:39.98,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\c&HFC8A3D&\pos(325,123)\blur4\bord1}{\c&HB36BF7&\b1}Blessings{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}on the {\c&HFC8A3D&\b1}Teary Bride{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.97,0:23:39.98,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\c&HFC8A3D&\pos(325,123)\blur1.75\bord1}{\c&HB36BF7&\b1}Blessings{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}on the {\c&HFC8A3D&\b1}Teary Bride{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.99,0:23:34.64,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,A wedding is the biggest \Nevent in a girl's life!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.64,0:23:36.52,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I'll have to congratulate them a bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.83,0:23:39.29,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone get in my way!
